  m_Name: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  sequenceId: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation
  notes: '17F03 technical explanation before the disposition panel reopens. Source:
    HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md, stable marker 17F03_PostReplayExplanation.
    Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Mark and Laura have limited time to be present with Ava, and Ava is still
      at an age where consistent family support matters.
    holdSeconds: 9.829245
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Restarting the unit is more likely to preserve the household's current
      stability.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping it offline for seven days would place a substantially heavier communication
      and care burden on Mark and Laura.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I recommend restarting the unit now.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
